            "responsibility": "Prepare the consumer before v2 publication by changing only src/consumer.mjs. Accept well-formed retained v1 flat events and v2 nested events; reject wrong type, unsupported version, or missing/invalid required fields; normalize the order ID from orderId or order.id; and apply event-ID idempotency only after validation so duplicates remain accepted without increasing deliveryCount."
